<wxs module="wxsProbe" src="./drag-probe.wxs"></wxs>

<view class="probe-page">
  <view class="probe-heading">
    <text class="probe-kicker">P1 · Android 诊断专用</text>
    <text class="probe-title">手势能力探针</text>
    <text class="probe-description">每个区域只验证一种真机输入能力，不接入业务页面。</text>
  </view>

  <view class="probe-card runtime-card">
    <view class="probe-card-heading">
      <text class="probe-card-title">C · 真机运行信息</text>
      <text class="probe-card-note">只在本页显示</text>
    </view>
    <view class="runtime-row"><text>代码版本</text><text>{{buildLabel}}</text></view>
    <view class="runtime-row"><text>基础库</text><text>{{sdkVersion}}</text></view>
    <view class="runtime-row"><text>微信版本</text><text>{{appVersion}}</text></view>
    <view class="runtime-row"><text>平台</text><text>{{platform}}</text></view>
    <view class="runtime-row"><text>设备</text><text>{{model}}</text></view>
    <view class="runtime-row"><text>系统</text><text>{{system}}</text></view>
  </view>

  <view class="probe-card wheel-probe-card">
    <view class="probe-card-heading">
      <text class="probe-card-title">E · WXS 年月滚轮候选</text>
      <text class="probe-card-note">慢滑、反向、吸附</text>
    </view>
    <view class="wheel-probe-frame">
      <ui-wheel-column
        aria-label="WXS 年份滚轮测试"
        items="{{wheelItems}}"
        unit="年"
        selected-index="{{wheelSelectedIndex}}"
        runtime-key="gesture-probe-year"
        generation="{{wheelGeneration}}"
        command-revision="{{wheelCommandRevision}}"
        bindpreviewchange="handleWheelPreview"
        bindsettle="handleWheelSettled"
      ></ui-wheel-column>
      <view class="wheel-probe-rails"></view>
      <view class="wheel-probe-mask"></view>
    </view>
    <view class="wheel-probe-evidence">
      <view><text>实时目标</text><text>{{wheelPreviewLabel}}</text></view>
      <view><text>最终静止</text><text>{{wheelSettledLabel}}</text></view>
      <view><text>生命周期</text><text>generation {{wheelGeneration}}</text></view>
    </view>
    <view
      class="wheel-probe-reset"
      hover-class="is-pressed"
      aria-role="button"
      aria-label="重置 WXS 年份滚轮到 2026 年"
      bindtap="handleWheelReset"
      >重置滚轮</view
    >
    <text class="probe-instruction"
      >数字必须逐像素缩放和淡入；松手只吸附一次，吸附中反向应立即接管。</text
    >
  </view>

  <view class="probe-card">
    <view class="probe-card-heading">
      <text class="probe-card-title">A · Skyline Pan Worklet</text>
      <text class="probe-card-note">拖动蓝点</text>
    </view>
    <pan-gesture-handler
      class="worklet-probe-handler"
      style="width: 280px; height: 220px"
      worklet:ongesture="handleProbePan"
    >
      <view class="worklet-probe-surface" style="width: 280px; height: 220px">
        <view id="gesture-probe-dot" class="gesture-probe-dot"></view>
      </view>
    </pan-gesture-handler>
    <text class="probe-instruction">蓝点能跟手移动：gesture-handler Worklet 正常。</text>
  </view>

  <view class="probe-card">
    <view class="probe-card-heading">
      <text class="probe-card-title">D · WXS 视图层触摸</text>
      <text class="probe-card-note">拖动黄色点</text>
    </view>
    <view
      class="wxs-probe-surface"
      style="width: 280px; height: 220px"
      bindtouchstart="{{wxsProbe.touchStart}}"
      bindtouchmove="{{wxsProbe.touchMove}}"
      bindtouchend="{{wxsProbe.touchEnd}}"
      bindtouchcancel="{{wxsProbe.touchEnd}}"
    >
      <view id="wxs-probe-dot" class="wxs-probe-dot"></view>
    </view>
    <text class="probe-instruction">黄色点能跟手移动：WXS 可作为矩阵的视图层输入候选。</text>
  </view>

  <view class="probe-card">
    <view class="probe-card-heading">
      <text class="probe-card-title">B · 普通触摸事件</text>
      <text class="probe-card-note">滑动灰色区域</text>
    </view>
    <view
      class="touch-probe-surface"
      bindtouchstart="handleTouchStart"
      bindtouchmove="handleTouchMove"
      bindtouchend="handleTouchEnd"
    >
      <text>{{touchStatus}}</text>
      <text>touchmove：{{touchMoveCount}} 次</text>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
